An '''Energy focus''' is part of the [[Chambers of Xeric/Strategies#Crab puzzle|crab puzzle]] within the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. These energy focuses have to be bounced off of [[Jewelled crab]]s to hit a crystal with the right colour. 

When an energy focus hits a jewelled crab of a certain colour, it will change into that colour.

